US series by year, drawn statically by HillMoneyLayer:
- fedFunds 1955-2026, mortgage30, treasury10;
- tariffRate 1947-2026 (customs duties over goods imports), customsDuties;
- goodsImports 1947-2026 ($bn);
- tradeShare 1947-2025 (exports plus imports over GDP).
There is no exports series, so no balance can be computed from this file alone.

